 "title": "A Rare Boat Race",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🚣",
 "sentences": [
  "The 2021 Boat Race moved locations.",
  "Usually held in London, it happened on the River Great Ouse near Ely instead.",
  "This was the 166th men's race and the 75th women's race.",
  "For the first time ever, both races were officiated by female umpires.",
  "Cambridge won both events, despite Oxford being favourites in the men's race.",
  "The 2020 race was cancelled due to the pandemic."
